This directory packages MINI's single phone-local gomobile runtime
(one libgojni.so). Two gomobile AARs cannot coexist in one app, so every
package below is statically linked into the same native library and called
from the Kotlin app over JNI. Legally that is one combined work.

Full module-by-module inventory: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
(regenerate with license-inventory.ps1). Analysis and options:
docs/LICENSING_COMPLIANCE_2026-10-20.md.

